OL,3,AEthiopia warns Eritrea it will defend
OL,4,Aitself after troops cross border
OL,5,
OL,6,FEthiopia has accused Eritrea of an
OL,7,F"all-out invasion" of its northern
OL,8,FTigray region and warned it will defend
OL,9,Fitself, days after residents told the
OL,10,FBBC Eritrean troops had crossed into
OL,11,Fthe country.
OL,13,FIn a letter to the UN Security Council,
OL,14,FEthiopia's foreign minister called it a
OL,15,F"blatant act of aggression that engages
OL,16,FEthiopia's inherent right to
OL,17,Fself-defence", following reported
OL,18,Fstrikes on Eritrean troops in Tigray.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,316,300,200,140,0,100
