OL,3,AEthiopia warns Eritrea it will defend
OL,4,Aitself after troops cross border
OL,5,
OL,6,FEritrean Information Minister Yemane
OL,7,FGebremeskel responded by saying it was
OL,8,Ffacing "an unprovoked war of
OL,9,Faggression" from its neighbour.
OL,11,FFighting broke out between the
OL,12,Fgovernment and the party that controls
OL,13,FTigray, the Tigray People's Liberation
OL,14,FFront (TPLF), two weeks ago.
